            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 4,
            "default": 4
          },
          "prompt_extend": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "开启智能提示词扩写，会增加约 3-4 秒延迟。适用于 `wan2.6-t2i`、`wan2.6-image`（仅编辑模式）及 `z-image-turbo`。`z-image-turbo` 开启后费用更高（详见定价）。wan2.6 系列默认值：`true`，z-image-turbo 默认值：`false`。",
